<p id="A4.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.T9" title="In D.1 More Details on Experiments with Irrelevant Information ‣ Appendix D Surface Form Analysis ‣ Moral Preferences of LLMs Under Directed Contextual Influence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows the exact wording of normal (informative) contextual influences and their matched irrelevant counterparts used in the surface form analysis.</p>
</div>
